'' See the source's header. The rule was "a UDT first argument means the call is the
'' program's own" -- right for AfxNova's 'Left( byref as DWSTRING, n )', wrong when NO
'' overload takes that UDT, where fbc keeps the builtin.
''
'' Both halves are asserted at runtime by build/goldenrun.sh: the builtin answering 42
'' for a W, and the overload still answering for a V. An IR assertion cannot see which
'' of the two ran.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-ir tests/mir/src/builtin-beside-foreign-overload.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-OUT: verify: ok
'' EXPECT-OUT: 0 statements not lowered
